{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20140","headline":"送魏端公入朝 · 孟郊","name":"送魏端公入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东洛尚淹翫，西京足芳妍。\n大宾威仪肃，上客冠劒鲜。\n岂惟空恋阙，亦以将朝天。\n局促尘末吏，幽老病中弦。\n徒怀青云价，忽至白发年。\n何当补风教，爲荐三百篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}